
# Environment Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5041
@apiPath = /api/game
@contentType = application/json
@accept = application/json
@testMatchId = 1
@testPlayer2 = bob

### Join Existing Match
# Allows an authenticated player to join a waiting match.
# Replace {matchId} with actual match ID from waiting matches
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/match/{{testMatchId}}/join
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept: {{accept}}
{{authHeader}}

{}

###

### Join Match - Cannot Join Own Match
# A player cannot join their own match (identity comes from the JWT)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/match/{{testMatchId}}/join
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept: {{accept}}
{{authHeader}}

{}

